WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.900
Can I publish a hundred posts

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:04.967
in one year? 79 so far.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.900
Every post is a waypoint on

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:10.767
the trail, from 2 Jan 2026 to

00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:11.933
30 Oct 2026.

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:15.267
Month by month. The busiest,

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:16.900
June: 12 posts.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.267
100 Days To Offload. The

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:21.633
timidness of time. Chronicles

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.667
of Wandering Mind: S2E01…

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.633
Mostly self-reflection, digital

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.433
wellbeing, personaldevelopment. 9

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.633
of them in Marathi.

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:31.600
79 posts by day 308. The pace

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:33.600
says 84: 5 behind pace.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:36.400
The same trail in two shells:

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:38.467
classic, or the atlas, a

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.567
writer's desk on the map.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:45.000
79 down. 21 to go.
